  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "Fig. 15, 'Illustration of how countries can share data with the WHO hosted PCMT'. It extends Fig. 14. As there, the global catalogue feeds country catalogues A and B inside the PRODUCT CATALOGUE MANAGEMENT TOOL on WHO infrastructure, used by Country A and Country B users. In addition, each country catalogue returns 'Product master data' to the global catalogue, and OTHER COUNTRIES contribute PRODUCT MASTER DATA into it from above, so the global catalogue is fed by the countries as well as feeding them.",
